{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"c7177f834ce06afe6f8e308e6fdf1bf7bad0b95c25021ae1030b1b97739831c2","ja":"海美のおかげで、ミキもおもいっきり体を動かせたの。\nこれでケーキ1つ分のお腹は空いたよね♪","zh":"多亏了海美，米希也尽情活动了一番身体。这样一来，肚子已经饿到能吃下1个蛋糕了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d7c8740f272d9e080679b5995891d8c3ccf47b6635b6185589824a2b9fa5a7a0","ja":"え？　ケーキ？\nおしることかおせちじゃなくって？","zh":"诶？蛋糕？\n不是年糕小豆汤或者年节料理吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"6cbe710b71f51b7f99eec1d7293b75cfd72e11a21f37ccda3e34fed6edf74d1b","ja":"うん、●●●●プロデューサーのお土産なの。\nお正月からお仕事頑張ったミキたちにって♪","zh":"嗯，这是●●●●制作人的伴手礼。\n是送给新年开始就努力工作的美希她们的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"1490325b7bb857d2b72c471651631f6446b48f9eef6756340eae0ca612ac3001","ja":"だからミキ、ケーキを美味しく\r\n食べるために羽根つき頑張ったの♪","zh":"所以美希为了能美美地吃蛋糕，努力打了羽根毽子♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"317aebbe8ce51cedfe758cf4338ef4c1f2d9a5782bcda6e83566a6704bffdedf","ja":"そうだったんだ～……あれ？　じゃあ、\nそれって私たちの分もあるってこと？","zh":"原来是这样啊～……咦？那就是说，\n连我们的份也有吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"78a2c10ef6cca655ef6b175e6576d962d866d8a2c286d5dbb4857a4321f53eb0","ja":"うん、もちろん。みんなで食べよ☆","zh":"嗯，当然。大家一起吃吧☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_986.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"415d68f7f42b93fc7db3eea81a27bc8f90274e92f93e7cd0857a85559c84bed7","ja":"やった～、食べる食べる！\n行こ、ミキミキ、ももちん！","zh":"太好了～要吃要吃！\n走吧，MikiMiki、Momo亲！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
